#, no-wrap
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "DESKRIPSI"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-welcome-patch.8:14
msgid ""
"B<minios-welcome-patch> adds a managed block of MiniOS preferences to each "
"supported Firefox system configuration file. Before changing a file, it "
"stores the unmodified contents in a file with the B<.bak> suffix. Repeated "
"invocations do not duplicate the managed block."
msgstr ""
"B<minios-welcome-patch> menambahkan blok preferensi terkelola MiniOS ke "
"setiap berkas konfigurasi sistem Firefox yang didukung. Sebelum mengubah "
"berkas, utilitas ini menyimpan isi asli ke berkas dengan akhiran B<.bak>. "
"Pemanggilan berulang tidak akan menduplikasi blok terkelola."

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-welcome-patch.8:17
msgid "Desktop-specific preferences are selected using B</etc/minios/config>."
msgstr "Preferensi khusus desktop dipilih menggunakan B</etc/minios/config>."

#. type: SH
#: en/minios-welcome-patch.8:17
#, no-wrap
msgid "OPTIONS"
msgstr "OPSI"

#. type: TP
#: en/minios-welcome-patch.8:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "B<--check>"
msgstr "B<--check>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-welcome-patch.8:23
msgid ""
"Exit with status 0 when every existing supported Firefox configuration file "
"contains the MiniOS managed block. Exit with status 3 when an existing file "
"is not configured, or 4 when no supported configuration file exists."
msgstr ""
"Keluar dengan status 0 jika setiap berkas konfigurasi Firefox yang didukung "
"sudah berisi blok terkelola MiniOS. Keluar dengan status 3 jika ada berkas "
"yang belum dikonfigurasi, atau 4 jika tidak ada berkas konfigurasi yang "
"didukung."

#. type: SH
#: en/minios-welcome-patch.8:23
#, no-wrap
msgid "FILES"
msgstr "BERKAS"

#. type: TP
#: en/minios-welcome-patch.8:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "B</etc/minios/config>"
msgstr "B</etc/minios/config>"

#. type: Plain text
#: en/minios-welcome-patch.8:27
msgid "MiniOS system configuration."
msgstr "Konfigurasi sistem MiniOS."

#. type: TP
#: en/minios-welcome-patch.8:27
